CharacterSurfaceCategory<public><localizes>:message = "Surfaces a custom character touches"
SurfaceSizeToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Box size (cm. Forward / back, left / right, up / down). Used if all components are above 0, ignoring the entity's scale. Default 0 (entity scale x MeshSizeCm)"
SurfaceMeshSizeToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Edge length of the mesh at scale 1 (cm). Multiplied by the entity's scale when SizeCm is not used. Default 100"
SurfacePivotAtBottomToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, the entity's position is the center of the box's bottom face (a mesh with its origin at the bottom). When off, the center of the box. Default on"
TouchMarginToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Margin added to the body's box (cm). The body stops 2 cm short of surfaces, so make it larger than that. Default 8"
TouchStandToleranceToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Counts as standing on a surface when the feet are within this distance (cm) of its top face. Default 15"
TouchSearchRadiusToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Only surfaces within this distance (cm) of the feet are candidates. Default 3000"
TouchRefreshToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Interval for refreshing the candidate surfaces (seconds). Default 0.5"
RideMaxCarryToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Does not follow a floor that moved more than this (cm) in one frame (so a warp / reset does not drag the body along). Default 300"
RideGraceToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "If grounding drops for a moment while the same floor is still right below the feet, keeps carrying as if riding for up to this many seconds (not used when leaving by a jump). 0 disables. Default 0.1"
RideInheritVelocityToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, adds the floor's velocity (excluding downward speed) to the body when leaving a moving floor (jump, falling off the edge), so it keeps moving with the floor. When landing from the air, removes the inherited part (no sliding on the floor). Default on"
RideFollowYawToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, when the surface ridden rotates (yaw), the body's position is also rotated around the surface by the same amount (the body's facing is unchanged). When off, only the surface's positional motion is carried. Default on"
